WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.720
Several years ago, my father and I were attending a conference in Texas, and we were registering at a very large convention center.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.500
It had been a long day. We traveled all the way there.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:20.280
And I remember as we came to the reception area, the registration lines, there were six different desks from which we could register.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.900
And I tend to look for the shortest lines possible.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:29.180
And I'm looking around, and it looks like the second line is the shortest.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:36.060
And so I said to my dad, let's get in line two, and hopefully we can get through this process as quickly as possible.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:43.300
Well, my dad, 99% of the time, would just happily just go in whatever line I suggested.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:48.620
But for some reason, on this occasion, he looked at me and said, I think I'm going to get in line three.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.980
And so we were a bit giddy from traveling all day.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.800
And so I said, well, then we'll have a race.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.800
And so we both get in different lines.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:57.700
I'm in line two.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:58.580
He's in line three.

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:03.400
and there are long lines in each and so we're just biding our time. I'm checking my emails

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:09.900
and I lose track of time. I lose track of my dad and then all of a sudden I hear a woman's voice

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:18.520
shouting out, it's you, it's you and I come to my senses. I look over and my dad has beaten me. My

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:24.200
dad is at the registration table and the woman registering him is shouting loud enough for

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:30.540
everyone to hear. It's you. It's you. So I make my way over to my dad to find out what's happening.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:38.260
And this woman tearfully begins telling her story. She had been in an abusive childhood

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:44.400
and had suffered some terrible hurts as she was growing up. And she ended up having a very low

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:50.260
sense of self-worth and suffered from depression. By the time she got to university,

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:57.820
she had such terrible suicidal depressed thoughts that all she could think about was ending her life

00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:03.540
and one day she decided it was time to do that very thing and she was walking during the lunch hour

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:10.440
through the green space of her university planning to throw herself over a bridge where other students

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:15.560
had taken their lives in the past but as she's walking through the green space all of a sudden

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:21.800
she thinks she can hear someone calling her name now there's all kinds of students having lunches

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:27.400
and visiting and throwing frisbees out on the green space but in the midst of all of the noise

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:33.480
of others she could swear that someone's calling her name so she starts to walk faster trying to

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:38.600
get away from whoever might be calling her but the voice is getting closer and closer and she

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:42.920
doesn't want to run and make it obvious she's trying to escape but she's walking as quickly as

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:49.520
she can. And then suddenly someone grabs her arm and she turns around and it's a friend that she

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:55.360
has. And the friend says, I've been looking all over for you. She said, there's a new Bible study

00:02:55.360 --> 00:03:01.640
that we've been doing and it's amazing. And she said, as I was in the study last week, God just

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:08.260
put on my heart that you need to be in this study. And today he just put an urgency in my heart to

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:14.400
find you and to bring you with me. Well, the woman contemplating suicide said, well, I'm busy today.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:18.960
I don't have time today. And her friend won't take no for an answer. She's literally holding

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:24.580
onto her arm and saying, I can't go there without you. You've got to come with me. And so finally,

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:30.620
reluctantly, this woman had agreed to go to the Bible study and then intending to take her life

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:36.340
once the study was over. But she went into that study. It happened to be experiencing God. And

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:41.860
That week they were studying the truth, the reality, that God pursues a love relationship

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:42.460
with you.

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:48.660
And even as she began to listen to the study that day, it began to dawn on her that her

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.180
heavenly father had been pursuing her all of her life.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:57.380
And regardless of what her earthly father had done and others had done, her heavenly

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:01.300
father had never given up pursuing her and reaching out to her.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:06.000
And even on the day she was going to take her life, God was alerting someone else to

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.220
frantically run all over the university campus to find her and bring her into a place where she

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:16.760
could learn of his love for her. And as she told us that story, my dad and I looked at each other

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:22.340
and we both realized that if I had had my way, my dad would have been one line away from ever

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:28.180
meeting that woman. But the spirit of God had told my dad that day, no, you can't go in line two

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:33.460
today. Today, you've got to be in line three. And as we saw that, we thought, isn't God good?

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:41.040
That no matter how far you go, no matter how hard you run, God continues to pursue you in a love relationship.
